  "worldAbout": {
    "title": "Eden District",
    "what": "A small neighbourhood linking a pond and grassy commons with four homes, a library and an old-town square.",
    "tour": "Start on the commons. West is the pond and its bank; the pavilion shelters the eastern lawn. Continue east past the four houses to Old Town Square. The library stands just north of the square.",
